      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just failing everyone. seeing my kids struggle with everything... the money, the stress, just life in general... and i feel like i'm the reason it's so heavy for them. like i'm just a weight they have to carry around every single day. i'm just a burden to them.",
