      "content": "it's just not that simple. a counselor isn't going to change the fact that i'm not enough for them. i look at them and all i see is more struggle because i'm here. it feels like every time i try to help, i just end up making things harder. i just want them to be able to breathe without feeling the weight of my failures. i just want them to have a chance at a life that isn't defined by my mess.",
